graph TB
    subgraph Human Interface
        User[User Query] --> Parser[Semantic Query Parser]
        Synthesizer[Response Synthesizer] -->|Detailed Answer with Citations| User
    end

    subgraph LLM Planner & Router
        Router[Search Query Router] <--> Plan[Multi-Hop Planner]
        RePlan[Gap Detector & Re-planner] <--> Router
    end

    subgraph External Tools & Sensors
        SearchAPI[Search Index APIs <br> Google / Bing]
        Scraper[Web Crawler & Scraper]
        Interpreter[Python Code Interpreter <br> Wolfram Alpha API]
    end

    subgraph Memory & Context Cache
        Episodic[Episodic Memory <br> Visited URLs & Extracted Snippets]
        Context[Short-Term Context <br> Conversation History]
    end

    %% Flow
    Parser -->|Context & Intent| Router
    Context <--> Router
    Router -->|Decomposes Query| Plan
    Plan -->|Sub-query 1 & 2| SearchAPI
    SearchAPI -->|Search Results URLs| Scraper
    Scraper -->|Extracted Web Body Content| Episodic
    Episodic -->|Cached Data Snippets| LLMCheck[LLM Synthesis Judge]
    LLMCheck -->|Math Validation| Interpreter
    Interpreter -->|Validated Calculations| LLMCheck
    
    LLMCheck -->|Information Complete?| RePlan
    RePlan -->|No: Issue Follow-up Search| Router
    RePlan -->|Yes: Final Synthesize| Synthesizer
